LocalScanRecoveryTest#scanListRespectsServerConfidenceBandsAtBoundaries
CameraX captured a JPEG and opened photo review. Ambil ulang deleted it and
returned to the camera. Only the replacement photo was uploaded (HTTP 201).
Go returned five candidates from the controlled worker. The list excluded 0.49
and the unknown class (0.95). At 0.50 and 0.699, the rows showed the uncertainty
message. At 0.70, the initially selected row had no uncertainty message. The two
highest scores both round to 70% in the UI. Selecting 0.50 deselected 0.70 and
still required material confirmation. Closing the sheet deleted the retake.
Instrumentation: Time: 14.205; OK (1 test).

LocalScanRecoveryTest#rapidDoubleTapSavesOneAiAssistedLog
CameraX → Go detection → actionable Recycle recommendation from the worker
fixture → editor. Filled 250 g and injected a rapid double tap on Simpan catatan.
The proxy held the committed receipt for two seconds and recorded only one
save (HTTP 201, RECYCLE, AI provenance present). The app showed confirmation
and 10 XP. PostgreSQL confirmed one record at 250 g and one AI metadata row.
Instrumentation: Time: 21.575; OK (1 test).
